<main class="store-shell" id="main-content"><section class="store-hero" aria-labelledby="portal-title"><div class="store-kicker">STEP 24 • MOBILE-READY PRODUCT PORTAL</div><h1 id="portal-title">Browse products with source-listed MRP, then send an order request for confirmation.</h1><p>Prices shown here use the current active India price-list MRP in the Business OS. This portal does not silently assign Preferred/Associate eligibility, collect payment, estimate tax or expose internal cost and stock quantities.</p></section>
